OL,3,GNEWSASchoolboy imposter subjected
OL,4,Aex-professor and wife to 'terrifying
OL,5,Aordeal'
OL,6,
OL,7,FMy Old School, starring Alan Cumming,
OL,8,Fchronicled MacKinnon's return to
OL,9,FBearsden Academy, as Brandon Lee, a
OL,10,F16-year-old who had supposedly just
OL,11,Fmoved to Scotland from Canada.
OL,13,FMacKinnon hatched the plan so he could
OL,14,Fpursue his dream of becoming a doctor
OL,15,Fhaving been thrown out of Glasgow
OL,16,FUniversity, when Prof Whiting was dean
OL,17,Fof the medical school.
